to really talk to one another.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:50.510
And they decide what
they should buy.

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.280
I know it, because
I get an alert.

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:55.370
They just bought this online
using my credit cards.

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:58.590
