not something for his wife.

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:39.620
That's the decision
that we need to get to.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:42.710
There are really interesting
dynamics going on in here.

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:45.320
But both of the
decisions that we're

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:47.510
