00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:47.420
Serverless architecture,
ingestion services,

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:51.370
batch and stream processing all
unified, not one or the other,

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:55.880
both with the same set of code.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:59.780
Comprehensive set of analytics
tools, from your ML tools

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:03.620
to TensorFlows to
BigQuerys, you name it,

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:07.750
and all the flexibilities
that you need.

