00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:20.440
And it is very global,
and I'll share with you,

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:23.470
and my partners in here will
share their experience as well

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:24.970
and how they are doing it.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:31.090
Dataflow is designed to handle
both batch and stream needs,

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:32.290
and you do it only once.

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:33.580
You code it once.

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.422
Use it for both of them.

00:10:35.422 --> 00:10:36.880
And that's how we
are designing it.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:39.910
And we use all these internally
within the Google family

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:40.780
as well.

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:44.170
And for all your analyses,
you can use your Cloud ML.

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:45.760
You can use your BigQuery.

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:51.950
We're making it as easy as
possible for you to leverage.

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:55.220
And open source,
