00:26:32.370 --> 00:26:34.260
They wanted higher
functionality.

00:26:34.260 --> 00:26:38.040
And most importantly, they
wanted real-time analytics.

00:26:38.040 --> 00:26:42.460
Our monolithic approach was,
therefore, no longer effective.

00:26:42.460 --> 00:26:45.450
And we started to think
about the right tools

00:26:45.450 --> 00:26:47.870
