00:28:40.230 --> 00:28:42.110
And so today, we can
provide our clients

00:28:42.110 --> 00:28:45.890
with some real-time
analytics and indicators.

00:28:49.420 --> 00:28:55.190
And finally, let's take
a look at our next steps.

00:28:55.190 --> 00:28:58.930
First, we predict that the
number of events processing

00:28:58.930 --> 00:29:05.170
