00:31:36.343 --> 00:31:37.260
So that's pretty huge.

00:31:37.260 --> 00:31:38.230
EVREN ERYUREK:
That's pretty good.

00:31:38.230 --> 00:31:39.740
I saw that example for UNICEF.

00:31:39.740 --> 00:31:40.700
That's 18% profit.

00:31:40.700 --> 00:31:42.460
That's pretty good
